G1 X48 Z0.05 F8000       ; wipe, move close to the bed
G1 X51 Z0.2 F8000        ; wipe, move quickly away from the bed
G92 E0                   ; reset extruder
M221 S100                ; set flow to 100%
G1 E-0.70000 F2100 ; retract
G1 Z0.400 F9000 ; lift
